# Settings > Updates (report 047 P1): a release build that is current (0.8.13, the newest release of the fake list):
# "Up to date" in green on the Settings root and on the Launcher row, the Launcher level (What's new in the running
# version, from the release list, the version line), What's new with one version. Review only: no golden.
title updates up to date
review
sizes 640x480 480x800 480x640 720x720 1280x800
@480x800,480x640 profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30 2026-11-05
wifi 70
bt on
update net on
update build 0.8.13 release arm64
update answer releases-0.8.13.json
home
header home
launch Settings
wait 300
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 1000
shot updates_uptodate
header updates_uptodate "Settings > Updates" Updates
expect_text "Up to date"
expect_color "Up to date" 00CC66
key ENTER
wait 300
shot updates_uptodate_launcher
expect_text "What's new in 0.8.13"
expect_text "0.8.13, release, arm64"
key ENTER
wait 300
shot updates_uptodate_whatsnew
key ESC
key ESC
key ESC
wait 300
shot updates_uptodate_root
expect_text "Up to date"
